  "text_pages": [
    "4. Other Courses Taught in English | Tohoku University\n4. Other Courses Taught in English\nTOP\n>\nFor International Students\n>\nExchange Programs\n>\nJYPE\n>\n4. Other Courses Taught in English\nOther Courses Taught in English\nStudents in this program can also take* the courses for The Future Global Leadership (FGL).\nFaculty /\nSchool\nCourse\nFields\nScience\nAdvanced Molecular Chemistry Course (AMC)\nChemistry, Science\nEngineering\nInternational Mechanical and Aerospace Engineering Course Undergraduate (IMAC-U)\nMechanical and Aerospace Engineering, Engineering\nAgriculture\nApplied Marine Biology Course (AMB)\nApplied Biosciences, Agriculture\n*Upon the approval from academic advisors and course instructors.\nDetails of course registration will be explained during the program orientation."
  ],
